### 🛠️ Core Linked List Operations

#### 1. Traversal Pattern
```cpp
ListNode* curr = head;
while (curr != nullptr) {
    curr = curr->next;
}
```

#### 2. The Dummy Head Node Pattern
When operations modify or remove the head node:

```cpp
ListNode dummy(0);
dummy.next = head;
ListNode* prev = &dummy;
// ...
return dummy.next;
```

